  "description": "Shared Consul service discovery for NextLevel backends. One blocking-query watcher per process, shared by every consumer, with the NextLevel metadata contract (nl-public-host, nl-env, nl-kind, nl-game-code, nl-launch-url, nl-subdomain) typed once. Includes the game-catalog surface used by game-launch-api. Takes no reverse-proxy dependency — the gateway's YARP integration lives in NextLevel.ServiceDiscovery.Yarp.",
